OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F338A1786034874
OL,3,CMajor search for 13-year-old boy,
OL,4,Cmissing off the coast of Hornsea
OL,6,FA search is underway for a missing 13-
OL,7,Fyear-old boy who got into difficulty
OL,8,Fin the sea off the coast of Hornsea.
OL,10,FEmergency services were called to
OL,11,FSouth Promenade at around 6pm on
OL,12,FTuesday, 4 August to reports a teenage
OL,13,Fboy was in the water.
OL,15,FAlongside HM Coastguard, Yorkshire
OL,16,FAmbulance Service and Humberside Fire
OL,17,Fand Rescue Services, Humberside Police
OL,18,Fofficers have been deployed to the
OL,19,Farea.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G1/4
