PN,33802
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F338A1786034874
OL,3,CMajor search for 13-year-old boy,
OL,4,Cmissing off the coast of Hornsea
OL,6,FSpecialist Police Search Advisors
OL,7,F(POLSA) have been deployed along with
OL,8,Fa Marine Unit and drone pilots.
OL,10,FChief Superintendent Phil Booker said:
OL,11,F"After receiving the report, officers
OL,12,Fwere immediately deployed alongside
OL,13,Fother emergency services and upon
OL,14,Fattending, it was discovered that a 13-
OL,15,Fyear-old boy had reportedly got into
OL,16,Fdifficulty whilst swimming in the
OL,17,Fwater.
OL,26,@sD@AOU
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G2/4
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,339,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33803
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F338A1786034874
OL,3,CMajor search for 13-year-old boy,
OL,4,Cmissing off the coast of Hornsea
OL,6,F"Our priority now is to find the boy,
OL,7,Fand members of the public can expect
OL,8,Fto see specialist Police Search
OL,9,FAdvisors (POLSA), along with our
OL,10,FMarine Unit and drone pilots, who have
OL,11,Falso been deployed to conduct an
OL,12,Fextensive search and rescue operation
OL,13,Fto locate him.
OL,15,F"We would urge people to please avoid
OL,16,Fthe area where possible to allow
OL,17,Femergency services to work efficiently
OL,18,Fand safely, and refrain from
OL,19,Fspeculating on the circumstances of
OL,20,Fthe incident.
OL,26,@nD@AOUwD@AOU
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G3/4
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
