OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,339,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33804
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F338A1786034874
OL,3,CMajor search for 13-year-old boy,
OL,4,Cmissing off the coast of Hornsea
OL,6,F"Our enquiries continue to ascertain
OL,7,Fthe full circumstances around the
OL,8,Freport, and we would ask anyone with
OL,9,Fany information that may assist us, to
OL,10,Fplease speak to the officers in
OL,11,FHornsea, or contact us via our non-
OL,12,Femergency number 101 quoting log 415
OL,13,Fof 4 August."
OL,26,@nD@AOUuD@MO]
